<title>USA: Central and South West names Shockley COO.</title>
<headline>Central and South West names Shockley COO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central and South West Corp said Friday it named executive vice president Thomas Shockley III president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to say whom Shockley, 52, replaces.</p>
<p>Shockley will continue to report to chairman and chief executive E.R. Brooks, the utility holding company said.</p>
